 does not talk about himself. But according to Harumichi, he is the most perfect butler with no need in alcohol, smoking, gambling or even wages."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Unbalanced to his short height, he possesses an abnormal strength."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c19366"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/30/305c377ea214d7c0a228e1052a99812942e1118bbdc9995fa71ee67914888f50.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4d57e5ea6e2f2e11ea01269b3a63fbaa57db2e6ab575de4ce631b43a830fb7a1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"空乃 太陽","creatorId":"vndb:s88","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s88","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s88","name":"岸尾 だいすけ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:7735","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c98603","characterName":"矢旗澤 政重","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c98603"},"originalCharacterName":"矢旗澤 政重","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The head of Yagisawa family who lives with his younger sister Kasumi in the family estate."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Being stuck at routine of his everyday life he feels depression and emptiness of his existence."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"But sudden death of his childhood friend, Harumichi, and appearance of the mysterious Girl left by Harumichi to him as a heritage, gives Masashige a new colour in his grey life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Will he keep his sanity fighting against everyday temptations or find another way to go through this?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Either way, his life will never be the same."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCh